WEBVTT

00:37.287 --> 00:39.706
What kind of madness is this, huh?

00:39.789 --> 00:43.084
Killing Mu-deok then reviving her?
Is that something to speculate?

00:43.168 --> 00:45.003
That foolish girl.

00:45.086 --> 00:47.630
I could not even stop them
since she volunteered.

00:49.132 --> 00:50.050
That girl…

00:52.802 --> 00:54.095
was actually smiling.

00:54.179 --> 00:56.139
Yes. I will try to do it.

01:01.644 --> 01:03.438
That childish fool!

01:03.521 --> 01:06.941
I bet she was just happy to hear that
she would get 100 yang in gold.

01:07.025 --> 01:09.152
Do you really think it was the gold…

01:11.571 --> 01:13.656
that made that girl smile like that?

01:25.752 --> 01:28.004
I do not like this situation either.

01:29.089 --> 01:31.341
So I will let you die now, painlessly.

01:31.424 --> 01:33.843
Everyone's gathered here
to see me brought back to life,

01:34.928 --> 01:37.097
not to see me die. So, please!

01:39.349 --> 01:43.686
They seem to be plotting to reveal
your true identity by stalling for time.

01:44.354 --> 01:47.273
After that girl dies,
intercept the power of the ice stone

01:47.357 --> 01:50.485
and shift your soul
into So-i's body right away.

01:50.568 --> 01:54.239
If the Queen dies here now,
we'll be able to end this meeting.

01:55.240 --> 01:59.285
We will leave Songrim
with the ice stone without trouble.

02:01.913 --> 02:04.791
Why do you think His Majesty
chose that girl?

02:05.500 --> 02:08.294
She's the weakest person here
without a doubt.

02:08.378 --> 02:10.004
It was an easy choice.

03:18.156 --> 03:19.199
So pretty!

03:20.617 --> 03:22.410
My dear Bu-yeon.

03:31.252 --> 03:32.378
Oh, Mother.

04:02.533 --> 04:04.911
Yes, Your Majesty, you can do this.

04:04.994 --> 04:07.497
Keep using that power to shift your soul.

04:07.580 --> 04:09.123
I'm not doing anything.

04:09.207 --> 04:12.627
The one moving the ice stone
is not actually me.

04:12.710 --> 04:13.544
Then who is?

05:00.383 --> 05:01.676
You have to stop it now.

05:13.438 --> 05:16.607
Mother, Mother, are you okay?

05:20.069 --> 05:21.154
Bu-yeon.

05:25.199 --> 05:27.744
Did she know? She must know!

05:28.328 --> 05:30.246
They're going to revive Mu-deok with that.

05:30.330 --> 05:32.165
They can't. She must die.

06:19.212 --> 06:20.338
What did you do?

06:20.922 --> 06:22.632
Where did you hide the ice stone?

06:26.511 --> 06:27.637
What just happened?

06:40.358 --> 06:41.609
Did you see that?

06:41.692 --> 06:44.862
The ice stone's energy touched
the energy of the sky.

06:44.946 --> 06:48.032
After that, the sky took away
the ice stone.

06:49.117 --> 06:50.660
It hasn't disappeared.

06:55.331 --> 06:56.499
It is…

06:57.458 --> 06:58.543
still here.

06:58.626 --> 06:59.752
Over there?

06:59.836 --> 07:02.547
Where? I don't see it.

07:28.072 --> 07:30.158
First, sudden thunder and lightning,

07:30.241 --> 07:32.285
and now, fog in the middle of the day?

07:32.368 --> 07:33.995
It's not just the fog.

07:34.078 --> 07:35.455
Something has gone wrong.

07:42.753 --> 07:45.381
- While I was unconscious?
- Yes.

07:45.465 --> 07:46.632
Is something wrong with the ice stone?

07:48.050 --> 07:49.510
Is this a dream?

07:49.594 --> 07:52.680
- There are flowers everywhere.
- This doesn't feel real.

07:52.763 --> 07:55.391
Are we dead right now? Is this heaven?

07:57.518 --> 07:58.478
Hey, hey!

07:58.561 --> 08:00.188
Enough of nonsense.

08:00.271 --> 08:02.482
If we are in heaven,
am I the Great Jade Emperor right now,

08:02.565 --> 08:03.649
he's an angel?

08:03.733 --> 08:06.402
Huh? An angel?

08:16.370 --> 08:17.413
What is that?

08:18.539 --> 08:19.999
I don't think it's an angel at least.

08:20.875 --> 08:22.043
Maybe a ghost?

08:31.177 --> 08:33.721
Are you all mages?

08:34.430 --> 08:36.682
Yes, we are mages of Jeongjingak.

08:40.686 --> 08:42.063
So you were here, too, Young Lady?

08:46.359 --> 08:47.610
Will you let go of me?

08:50.071 --> 08:53.824
Um, Jang Uk,
don't go anywhere and guard this place.

08:54.617 --> 08:55.868
You.

08:56.661 --> 08:57.662
Go there.

08:57.745 --> 09:00.957
- I will go to the Training Center.
- Royal Highness, we'll go with you.

09:04.168 --> 09:05.378
What is going on now?

09:06.003 --> 09:07.255
What was with the thunder?

09:07.338 --> 09:10.174
Unfortunately, we do not know
what is going on yet, either.

09:10.258 --> 09:13.261
I am sure we'll know once the fog clears.

09:13.928 --> 09:15.680
If we are in neither heaven nor hell,

09:15.763 --> 09:17.890
the flowers blooming makes no sense.

09:19.225 --> 09:20.810
Do you really think this is fog?

09:56.762 --> 09:58.222
What the hell are you guys doing, huh?

09:58.306 --> 10:00.683
Sorry, Royal Highness.
When we approached the door,

10:00.766 --> 10:02.768
we were pushed back by
a great force of wind all of a sudden.

10:02.852 --> 10:03.978
Wind?

10:05.354 --> 10:06.606
I don't see any wind around here.

10:10.276 --> 10:12.528
Don't go any further.
You cannot really see it,

10:12.612 --> 10:14.488
but it's true a great force
is blocking the way.

10:14.572 --> 10:16.824
What on earth is really going on now?

10:16.907 --> 10:17.867
It's a barrier.

10:19.368 --> 10:21.996
It seems a great barrier
is surrounding Jeongjingak.

10:23.122 --> 10:24.081
A barrier?

10:24.165 --> 10:25.666
Who would put up a barrier right here?

10:25.750 --> 10:26.917
Your Highness.

10:28.377 --> 10:29.837
Your Highness.

10:30.463 --> 10:33.382
A priestess of Jinyowon
is inside Jeongjingak.

10:33.466 --> 10:35.217
We found Jin Bu-yeon of Jinyowon,

10:35.301 --> 10:37.595
who brought the ice stone,
collapsed on the ground.

10:48.981 --> 10:49.815
Mu-deok.

11:06.165 --> 11:09.835
Energy generated by the ice stone
lingered around Jeongjingak

11:09.919 --> 11:11.921
and has become a barrier.

11:13.381 --> 11:15.800
Who is inside Jeongjingak as of now?

11:16.717 --> 11:18.427
Jang Uk and Seo Yul are absent.

11:18.511 --> 11:19.762
It seems like they are in there.

11:20.971 --> 11:22.556
Young Lady Heo is also in there.

11:22.640 --> 11:24.141
My dear Yun-ok!

11:24.225 --> 11:26.769
His Royal Highness
is also trapped inside the barrier.

11:27.436 --> 11:28.270
What?

11:28.354 --> 11:30.981
My dear Beom!
Is my son also in there?

11:31.065 --> 11:32.608
Where is my son, Jin-ho?

11:34.151 --> 11:36.445
Lady Jin, you must do something.

11:36.529 --> 11:39.740
Your daughter who was swept off
by the ice stone must also be in there.

11:40.366 --> 11:42.368
We must not touch the barrier.

11:42.451 --> 11:46.497
We all witnessed how this happened
when Jin Bu-yeon touched the ice stone.

11:47.123 --> 11:49.875
Jinyowon has caused all this
by using the ice stone.

11:51.335 --> 11:53.295
You asked me to show you its power,

11:53.963 --> 11:55.756
and now you are placing the blame on me?

11:56.799 --> 11:58.759
Are you really going to start fighting?

11:59.427 --> 12:02.096
Stop that now!
Our dear children are in there!

12:02.179 --> 12:03.764
Yun-ok!

12:20.948 --> 12:23.200
Does the sudden barrier
around Jeongjingak

12:23.284 --> 12:25.494
have anything to do with you,
the priestess, being here?

12:26.120 --> 12:27.913
What really happened
at the Training Center?

12:28.748 --> 12:30.082
Well…

12:40.009 --> 12:41.927
This is all happening
because of Mu-deok.

12:42.428 --> 12:45.806
Because she is
the real priestess, Jin Bu-yeon.

12:45.890 --> 12:49.685
But I cannot tell everyone
because they think I am her.

12:50.728 --> 12:51.979
What do I do?

12:52.563 --> 12:53.898
I asked you a question, priestess.

12:53.981 --> 12:55.149
I don't…

12:56.734 --> 12:58.027
I don't know.

12:58.110 --> 13:00.780
I have no idea
what happened since I can't see.

13:01.447 --> 13:04.200
There was a sudden gust of wind.
I fainted, then woke up here.

13:04.283 --> 13:06.202
You don't even know
how you actually got here?

13:06.285 --> 13:08.746
How could I know how I got to this place

13:08.829 --> 13:11.624
if I don't even have
any idea of where I am?

13:16.045 --> 13:18.798
Young Lady Jin Bu-yeon does not look
very well.

13:19.298 --> 13:21.967
She is very pale and
she's sweating a lot as well.

13:22.051 --> 13:23.344
How does she look to you?

13:25.513 --> 13:28.265
Perhaps you could question her
after she rests.

13:31.727 --> 13:32.728
All right, let her rest.

13:34.063 --> 13:34.980
Come.

13:40.694 --> 13:41.987
She is likely lying.

13:43.572 --> 13:44.740
What is she hiding?

13:44.824 --> 13:46.200
Not sure. Mu-deok must know.

13:47.034 --> 13:48.619
Mu-deok, were you with So-i?

13:51.247 --> 13:52.915
How come you're here in Jeongjingak?

13:54.166 --> 13:56.836
I was already here in the first place.

14:00.214 --> 14:01.048
You were already here?

14:02.174 --> 14:04.552
I thought you were serving tea
at the Training Center.

14:05.511 --> 14:08.931
I followed you here to Jeongjingak
as soon as I was done serving tea.

14:09.014 --> 14:12.017
I don't know what happened
at the Training Center.

14:12.977 --> 14:16.480
There's absolutely no point
in asking a servant such as her

14:16.564 --> 14:20.276
who only knows how to follow
her master around like a little puppy.

14:20.359 --> 14:21.569
You don't need to worry.

14:22.403 --> 14:24.864
The very best mages of Daeho are all
gathered around here.

14:24.947 --> 14:27.324
They will break this barrier
sooner or later.

14:28.492 --> 14:30.327
Go and bring some tea
for His Royal Highness.

14:30.411 --> 14:31.328
Oh, yes.

14:43.966 --> 14:46.886
"A servant who only knows
how to follow her master around

14:47.469 --> 14:49.096
like a lost little puppy dog."

14:50.973 --> 14:52.391
That's how Mu-deok is.

14:59.064 --> 15:00.357
Oh, dear!

15:00.441 --> 15:02.026
There is no water to boil.

16:01.835 --> 16:04.254
As always,
tea made with magic tastes best.

16:06.590 --> 16:07.841
It's been forever.

16:10.552 --> 16:12.471
My energy finally returned

16:13.389 --> 16:14.890
inside the ice stone.

16:24.191 --> 16:26.860
What's this? Where am I?

16:28.612 --> 16:30.906
It was not
taken from us this time.

16:31.740 --> 16:33.742
We are inside the ice stone.

16:35.369 --> 16:36.787
This is the ice stone?

16:37.830 --> 16:41.000
Because it's not bound to a shape or size,

16:41.625 --> 16:42.668
and can become…

16:43.919 --> 16:46.255
water, fire, or wind.

16:49.758 --> 16:52.052
Then, you mean
the ice stone is mine right now?

16:59.059 --> 17:01.478
No one can be
the master of the ice stone.

17:03.022 --> 17:05.107
You can only borrow its power.

17:05.190 --> 17:07.818
When something is pulled,
something is pushed.

17:07.901 --> 17:09.945
When something is gained,
something is lost.

17:10.029 --> 17:12.990
That is the burden of the person
who uses its power.

17:13.073 --> 17:15.576
I'm more than willing to bear as much.

17:15.659 --> 17:16.827
Go ahead, then.

17:17.327 --> 17:19.371
An overflowing spirit

17:19.997 --> 17:22.708
is not something you can just discard
after you're done with it.

17:23.500 --> 17:26.253
Just as you can't avoid floods
after wanting rain.

17:26.879 --> 17:29.590
Or avoid typhoons if you want wind.

17:30.549 --> 17:31.633
You must bear it.

17:32.134 --> 17:33.177
Who are you?

17:33.927 --> 17:35.554
Are you the relic of Jinyowon?

17:36.472 --> 17:38.891
How can you call me a relic
when you are the one

17:39.808 --> 17:41.268
living off this body?

18:10.005 --> 18:11.173
Jeongjingak?

18:17.513 --> 18:18.597
What was that?

18:20.099 --> 18:23.560
Was it a relic that latched onto
the ice stone when it was in Jinyowon?

18:29.525 --> 18:31.860
Hey, Mu-deok, what is this?

18:31.944 --> 18:34.613
This tea cup
for the Crown Prince has a chip in it.

18:34.696 --> 18:37.407
Oh, dear, I'm sorry. I will get another.

18:38.117 --> 18:41.453
Wait!
I do not need to be sorry anymore.

18:41.537 --> 18:42.996
- Mu-deok.
- Yes?

18:43.580 --> 18:45.999
The table is so dirty. Wipe it down.

18:46.083 --> 18:48.794
It is as if
being a servant is second nature.

18:48.877 --> 18:50.838
Have I completely become Mu-deok?

18:56.176 --> 18:57.803
I am not Mu-deok anymore.

18:57.886 --> 18:58.804
Mu-deok.

18:58.887 --> 19:00.764
Uh.

19:04.059 --> 19:06.979
We all haven't had much to eat today
because of the circumstances.

19:07.062 --> 19:08.480
Can you bring us something right now?

19:09.148 --> 19:11.775
Oh, you know,
that sujebi would be really nice.

19:11.859 --> 19:12.776
Okay?

19:19.533 --> 19:21.994
There is no Mu-deok after this sujebi.

19:22.786 --> 19:26.331
Once I am done making this,
there will be no more Mu-deok.

19:27.499 --> 19:29.751
As soon as I use the alchemy of souls
to leave this body,

19:29.835 --> 19:32.212
I can become anyone
who I would like to be.

19:34.464 --> 19:36.008
I can even be the King.

19:43.682 --> 19:45.225
Shall I kill my enemy

19:45.309 --> 19:47.102
and take over that body?

19:55.694 --> 19:58.030
I don't want that.

19:59.239 --> 20:00.949
Park Jin would be better.

20:11.501 --> 20:13.420
I can really be anyone I want.

20:14.004 --> 20:15.547
I guess I should think about it more.

20:17.049 --> 20:18.759
This is such a perfect dough.

20:18.842 --> 20:21.136
It's too good just for sujebi.

20:21.220 --> 20:22.804
Should I make noodles?

20:22.888 --> 20:24.473
Uk likes noodles much better.

20:28.894 --> 20:29.728
Hmm.

20:30.604 --> 20:32.689
There is a very faint taste of pheasant.

20:39.446 --> 20:43.367
I guess this will be the last meal
I prepare for Young Master.

20:53.335 --> 20:54.920
- Young Master.
- Oh.

20:56.296 --> 20:59.091
I made noodle soup. Go and have some.

20:59.174 --> 21:00.217
Yeah.

21:04.137 --> 21:05.722
With that, the servant Mu-deok

21:06.473 --> 21:07.474
will be going now.

21:09.393 --> 21:10.310
And thus…

21:12.521 --> 21:14.606
the master and pupil relationship is done.

21:16.316 --> 21:17.359
It's done?

21:19.069 --> 21:21.113
You may not have noticed yet, but…

21:21.863 --> 21:23.490
we're inside the ice stone and…

21:24.199 --> 21:26.368
I regained my power
just like that time on the lake.

21:28.996 --> 21:30.831
I will soon perform the alchemy of souls

21:31.790 --> 21:33.417
and leave this body for good.

21:35.419 --> 21:36.712
So, you will leave now?

21:37.754 --> 21:39.423
And you'll never see me again?

21:39.506 --> 21:41.383
That was our promise from the beginning.

21:41.967 --> 21:43.927
Once I get all my powers back, I'm done.

21:44.011 --> 21:46.888
We both agreed
to make another promise then.

21:53.895 --> 21:55.397
Uk, there will be…

21:57.566 --> 21:58.817
no promises.

22:07.868 --> 22:09.911
When something is gained,
something is lost.

22:09.995 --> 22:12.873
That is the burden of the person
who uses its power.

22:14.333 --> 22:16.543
If it is you I must lose to keep my power,

22:18.045 --> 22:19.463
then I'm going to bear it.

22:31.725 --> 22:33.643
- Young Master.
- Yeah?

22:33.727 --> 22:35.812
I made noodle soup, so go and have some.

22:36.563 --> 22:38.106
- And--
- Mu-deok.

22:38.190 --> 22:40.275
The thing surrounding
Jeongjingak right now,

22:40.359 --> 22:42.235
I think it's very likely
to be the ice stone.

22:42.819 --> 22:43.653
What?

22:44.279 --> 22:46.114
He should not have realized that.

22:48.241 --> 22:50.535
The ice stone is said
to be water, fire, and wind.

22:51.078 --> 22:53.080
I think the barrier was formed
by its wind.

22:54.456 --> 22:56.166
If we are really inside of it,

22:56.958 --> 23:00.295
do you think that there is a way to take
this power without no one knowing?

23:03.090 --> 23:04.216
I'm not sure.

23:04.299 --> 23:05.926
I've already reached Chisu.

23:06.676 --> 23:08.512
Can I just catch it like the Golden Fish?

23:08.595 --> 23:10.972
No, your powers pale in comparison
to the ice stone.

23:11.640 --> 23:12.849
It is impossible.

23:15.560 --> 23:18.438
I wish your power would return
just like at Lake Gyeongcheondaeho.

23:21.233 --> 23:22.567
You would be able to do it.

23:25.779 --> 23:27.406
What if my powers return

23:28.156 --> 23:30.325
and Naksu decides to run away with them?

23:32.285 --> 23:34.830
You may have to face death
if you end up getting caught.

23:36.248 --> 23:37.165
Aren't you afraid?

23:38.041 --> 23:40.252
I mean I already have considered that.

23:40.335 --> 23:42.295
You may run away
once you regain your power.

23:43.213 --> 23:47.092
And I already told you before,
I was prepared to take responsibility.

23:52.139 --> 23:52.973
But…

23:54.057 --> 23:55.600
I guess I'm a little afraid

23:56.977 --> 24:01.857
that you might just abandon me without
my promise even crossing your mind.

24:03.525 --> 24:04.484
Master.

24:04.568 --> 24:08.280
Don't abandon me.
If you do, I will cry my eyes out. Hmm.

24:11.074 --> 24:14.661
You say such
embarrassing things sometimes.

24:16.037 --> 24:18.039
You'll regret it
when you think of it later.

24:20.375 --> 24:22.836
As long as you can bear
the embarrassment, you'll be fine.

24:23.378 --> 24:26.965
Regret is felt last minute,
and it's irreversible.

24:28.633 --> 24:31.344
Master, endure the embarrassment

24:31.428 --> 24:32.512
and try to be honest.

24:33.013 --> 24:35.932
Then, you will not feel regret
at the last moment.

24:41.771 --> 24:44.065
- Jang Uk, I--
- Young Master Jang.

24:47.694 --> 24:48.778
I'm coming now.

24:49.571 --> 24:51.615
She has the key
to the chamber with the banned books.

24:51.698 --> 24:54.367
While I'm stuck here,
I'll go ahead and do some research.

24:55.410 --> 24:56.495
Oh, Mu-deok.

25:02.334 --> 25:03.919
Eat it by yourself. Do not get caught.

25:05.045 --> 25:06.046
Mm.

25:29.778 --> 25:33.323
Are the books
you are looking for about sorcery, Uk?

25:33.406 --> 25:36.952
Yeah, I heard that the books
my father took from the shamans

25:37.035 --> 25:39.663
who practiced sorcery are here
somewhere in the study.

25:40.914 --> 25:42.374
I want to see what they were.

25:42.999 --> 25:43.833
Hmm.

25:45.460 --> 25:47.379
Lord Jang left these books behind.

25:48.547 --> 25:50.006
Let me help you find them.

25:50.090 --> 25:53.552
I will be fine here by myself.
So you can leave the key with me and go.

25:55.262 --> 25:57.430
My grandfather left the key with me.

25:58.056 --> 25:59.474
How can I just leave it with you?

25:59.558 --> 26:01.935
Okay, I guess I'm not
the most trustworthy.

26:02.018 --> 26:03.562
You can stay and watch me, Yun-ok.

26:21.371 --> 26:23.290
Uh, everyone.

26:24.165 --> 26:27.877
There's enough space here
for everyone to sleep.

26:27.961 --> 26:30.589
And we have enough food, so don't worry.

26:31.423 --> 26:33.466
Settle down for now, all right?

26:34.259 --> 26:35.302
Yeah.

26:43.727 --> 26:46.646
Return to Gisan immediately
and bring everyone else here.

26:46.730 --> 26:49.482
The ice stone is here.
We need to claim our share of its power.

26:49.566 --> 26:50.650
Understood!

26:53.778 --> 26:55.989
Gather everyone
who is able to cast spells.

26:56.072 --> 26:57.949
Even the elderly and children.

26:58.033 --> 26:59.284
Yes, lord.

27:07.208 --> 27:10.337
Call all of the mages
in Cheonbugwan to Songrim now.

27:10.420 --> 27:12.714
There could be a conflict
over the ice stone,

27:12.797 --> 27:14.966
so we need to be prepared, too.

27:15.050 --> 27:16.051
Yes.

27:24.017 --> 27:24.893
Your Majesty.

27:24.976 --> 27:26.811
I'm quite concerned for your well-being.

27:26.895 --> 27:28.897
Perhaps, you should get some rest.

27:28.980 --> 27:33.109
I'm fine.
I need to see what happens.

27:33.818 --> 27:35.362
Since the ice stone appeared,

27:36.404 --> 27:38.323
the King's Star will also appear.

27:53.546 --> 27:56.883
Everyone must be waiting
for The Words of the Heart.

27:58.551 --> 27:59.844
Let's hurry in, then.

27:59.928 --> 28:00.762
Mm.

28:08.436 --> 28:09.479
Sang-ho.

28:09.562 --> 28:10.939
We brought back The Words of the Heart.

28:11.022 --> 28:12.857
That is not so important right now.

28:12.941 --> 28:14.734
A barrier has engulfed Jeongjingak.

28:15.318 --> 28:16.152
What?

28:24.369 --> 28:26.162
Will I be caught in the end?

28:28.331 --> 28:29.791
Then I will die.

28:52.063 --> 28:53.189
It's a honey biscuit.

28:54.232 --> 28:55.859
It seems like you've had nothing to eat.

28:56.401 --> 28:57.694
You should eat.

29:01.656 --> 29:03.324
Thank you so much.

29:05.201 --> 29:08.288
You must have been surprised
to find out I am Jin Bu-yeon.

29:08.830 --> 29:11.791
When we met last time,
it was before I found my real parents.

29:13.168 --> 29:14.586
This is the umbrella you gave me.

29:16.212 --> 29:18.465
I've always kept it with me since then,

29:18.548 --> 29:20.759
in hopes you'd recognize me
if we met again.

29:24.053 --> 29:27.182
I heard that Jin Mu helped you
find your parents, is that right?

29:27.265 --> 29:28.266
Yeah.

29:30.226 --> 29:34.272
Don't ever let him know about how
we had met before, Young Master.

29:36.649 --> 29:38.151
I'm worried that it would

29:38.818 --> 29:41.279
break my mother's heart
if she heard what I've been through.

29:43.281 --> 29:45.158
Please, do not tell him.

29:46.659 --> 29:48.620
They killed everyone
she had encountered.

29:49.287 --> 29:50.580
Did she keep me a secret?

29:53.416 --> 29:56.503
Jin Mu is unaware that
we already know of

29:57.086 --> 29:58.755
So-i's true identity?

29:58.838 --> 30:02.467
Then he must have killed all those people
in order to hide it from everyone else.

30:02.550 --> 30:05.303
In the end, she will die, too.

30:05.929 --> 30:08.681
If their plan was to shift
the Queen's soul into that body,

30:09.265 --> 30:11.100
they intended to kill her from the start.

30:11.184 --> 30:13.353
She's trying her best without knowing
they will kill her anyway.

30:13.436 --> 30:14.938
Jin Mu is only using her.

30:16.314 --> 30:18.274
Just like he used Naksu before.

30:22.028 --> 30:24.155
It's a very unfortunate situation.

30:26.658 --> 30:27.575
Young Master.

30:28.409 --> 30:29.661
Did you know

30:29.744 --> 30:32.080
that this umbrella is
no longer useful as an umbrella?

30:34.082 --> 30:37.335
Look over here. There's a hole in it.
It has been ripped.

30:39.003 --> 30:40.088
That's a shame.

30:40.171 --> 30:42.423
I was told that it was very high-quality.

30:42.507 --> 30:44.300
They must have deceived you, then.

30:50.515 --> 30:52.058
I have always been easy to deceive.

30:52.976 --> 30:54.227
Is that so?

31:34.601 --> 31:36.728
What do you mean?
Master Kang has disappeared?

31:36.811 --> 31:40.106
Uh, he drained her energy
and then walked out.

31:40.773 --> 31:43.276
We've looked everywhere,
but we can not find him.

31:43.359 --> 31:46.404
He couldn't have gone
anywhere near the Training Center.

31:46.487 --> 31:47.697
The Unanimous Assembly is there.

31:47.780 --> 31:49.699
It was crowded there all day.

31:49.782 --> 31:51.492
He couldn't have moved undetected.

31:51.576 --> 31:54.829
There is still a place he could be hiding

31:55.496 --> 31:56.873
at this moment.

31:59.584 --> 32:01.294
In the barrier of Jeongjingak

32:02.503 --> 32:04.339
with all the young mages.

32:42.377 --> 32:43.294
A soul shifter.

32:46.631 --> 32:48.049
I'm on Jin Mu's side.

32:52.971 --> 32:54.138
I know you.

32:54.806 --> 32:56.766
I saw your soul being shifted from a body

32:56.849 --> 32:59.143
of an old man into this body
that you have right now.

33:09.862 --> 33:12.865
We're in this together. Please, spare me.

33:15.451 --> 33:17.453
I need human energy immediately.

33:17.537 --> 33:19.163
I can definitely bring you someone.

33:19.247 --> 33:21.040
Surely, the energy of a mage
from Jeongjingak

33:21.124 --> 33:23.626
would be better than
taking energy from me alone.

33:24.252 --> 33:25.795
Stay hidden here,

33:25.878 --> 33:27.839
and I will bring someone to you, okay?

33:29.549 --> 33:31.634
- Jeongjingak's mages?
- Yes.

33:31.718 --> 33:33.386
There is a barrier
around this place right now,

33:33.469 --> 33:35.763
so I'm sure nobody can leave or enter.

33:36.389 --> 33:38.141
There's a barrier surrounding us?

33:53.698 --> 33:55.074
Young Lady Jin?

33:55.658 --> 33:56.868
What are you doing here?

33:57.410 --> 33:58.870
I was looking for something,

33:59.412 --> 34:01.956
but I have lost my umbrella
that I use as a cane.

34:02.915 --> 34:04.584
Oh, it's right here.

34:41.287 --> 34:45.166
I will spare your life.
Now go, bring me more.

34:45.750 --> 34:46.584
Okay.

34:50.546 --> 34:52.006
Of the mages here,

34:52.715 --> 34:54.175
is Seo Yul among them?

34:57.011 --> 34:57.845
Why?

35:01.349 --> 35:02.975
He cut me.

35:03.559 --> 35:05.144
So I'm going to kill him first.

35:06.479 --> 35:07.522
Seo Yul…

35:08.523 --> 35:09.690
is not here right now.

35:13.152 --> 35:14.403
Bring him to me…

35:16.239 --> 35:17.573
or I will kill you instead.

35:17.657 --> 35:18.533
I'll bring him.

35:20.243 --> 35:22.787
I also have someone here
I really need to get rid of.

35:24.205 --> 35:25.665
I will bring her here, then.

35:27.375 --> 35:29.043
So you can kill her first.

35:42.932 --> 35:45.226
How come your cooking is so bad, Mu-deok?

35:45.309 --> 35:46.519
Where did you learn to do this?

35:48.062 --> 35:49.814
Since I have not told Uk yet,

35:50.398 --> 35:52.150
I'll be Mu-deok just a bit longer.

35:53.192 --> 35:54.861
My apologies, Your Highness.

35:55.987 --> 35:57.905
This is the leader's wine
that Dang-gu hid away.

36:05.663 --> 36:06.998
How is it?

36:08.291 --> 36:09.834
It's pretty good. I like it.

36:10.418 --> 36:12.086
What are they doing out there?

36:12.170 --> 36:14.714
- Why haven't they taken down this thing?
- Still,

36:14.797 --> 36:16.966
within the barrier,
the flowers are blooming,

36:17.049 --> 36:18.259
the weather is nice,

36:18.342 --> 36:21.012
the air is filled with energy.
It's not too bad, is it?

36:22.263 --> 36:24.932
Royal Highness,
you must be bored looking at flowers.

36:25.016 --> 36:26.976
Would you like to see
my family's Hyeongong?

36:27.685 --> 36:30.188
Cha Beom's Hyeongong
is quite a sight to behold.

36:30.271 --> 36:31.189
Yeah?

36:32.106 --> 36:33.232
All right, let me see it, then.

36:33.816 --> 36:34.650
Of course.

37:20.905 --> 37:21.948
What?

37:22.031 --> 37:23.908
- Beom!
- Beom! Beom!

37:24.951 --> 37:26.452
Beom, wake up.

37:26.535 --> 37:28.454
- Huh?
- What? What just happened?

37:28.537 --> 37:29.872
Beom! Beom!

37:32.500 --> 37:34.585
Are you saying you lost
your energy when you used the spell?

37:34.669 --> 37:35.503
Yes.

37:35.586 --> 37:37.797
The whole time,
I felt like my energy was being drained.

37:37.880 --> 37:38.965
But it seems…

37:40.174 --> 37:42.343
…my energy has drained as water would.

37:43.219 --> 37:44.762
When I checked his energy,

37:44.845 --> 37:46.597
it was indeed empty.

37:48.391 --> 37:49.892
How did I lose my energy?

38:00.444 --> 38:01.821
Maybe it's the sword.

38:19.797 --> 38:22.216
The energy I gathered
in the sword just spilled out.

38:22.800 --> 38:24.802
It seems like it is the barrier
rather than the sword.

38:26.846 --> 38:29.432
I think this barrier takes the energy…

38:31.017 --> 38:32.560
that is used to cast a spell.

38:46.574 --> 38:48.367
Within the barrier,
there will be no spells,

38:48.451 --> 38:50.077
and, of course, no swords, either.

38:50.870 --> 38:52.455
Let's leave them right here,
just to be safe.

38:59.545 --> 39:00.463
Hmm.

39:01.172 --> 39:03.674
That's the assassin's sword
Master Lee took from me a while ago.

39:04.216 --> 39:05.343
He gave it to you, then?

39:05.426 --> 39:08.012
Yes, he told me to hold on to this sword.

39:08.095 --> 39:09.889
But Maidservant Kim
didn't like it at home,

39:09.972 --> 39:11.223
so I've been keeping it here.

39:26.072 --> 39:27.406
Keep this with you and…

39:27.990 --> 39:29.658
pass it on to him if he comes here.

39:31.619 --> 39:34.205
I can't really leave
and give it to someone else.

39:35.331 --> 39:36.540
Maidservant Kim.

39:37.666 --> 39:38.501
Yes.

39:39.001 --> 39:41.045
Has the Assembly ended
without any problems?

39:41.545 --> 39:42.880
Gosh! No! Far from it.

39:42.963 --> 39:46.217
Right now, mages from every region
are all flocking together to Songrim.

39:47.676 --> 39:49.095
It seems like something has happened.

39:50.513 --> 39:53.682
With all this commotion,
I imagine he will come.

40:01.273 --> 40:03.609
Is Gwanju Jang Gang really
going to come back here?

40:28.134 --> 40:30.177
Who are you to come to
Cheonbugwan like this?

40:33.264 --> 40:34.807
Gwanju, you're here!

40:39.437 --> 40:42.106
Who is the right-hand man
of the Assistant Gwanju

40:42.189 --> 40:43.524
of Cheonbugwan, Jin Mu?

41:08.632 --> 41:11.802
Cho Chung threatened me
saying he'd reveal Uk's birth.

41:11.886 --> 41:15.097
That's why I taught him
the alchemy of souls.

41:15.681 --> 41:18.976
Now that he is dead,
is there anything to worry about?

41:19.894 --> 41:22.897
Everything I did was for you
and the young master.

41:24.148 --> 41:27.651
I have lost both my closest friend
and my wife because of sorcery.

41:29.236 --> 41:31.197
I will dispose of the soul ejector,

41:31.947 --> 41:34.200
and seal the ice stone away
in Lake Gyeongcheondaeho.

41:34.825 --> 41:35.826
You cannot.

41:36.911 --> 41:39.497
You have gone through so much
to master this spell.

41:39.580 --> 41:40.956
How could you give up the ice stone?

41:41.582 --> 41:42.416
You cannot.

41:44.251 --> 41:46.212
Since you also mastered
the alchemy of souls,

41:47.171 --> 41:50.007
I must block your energy flow
so you cannot perform sorcery.

41:50.090 --> 41:51.342
Block my energy flow?

41:52.760 --> 41:54.220
You cannot.

42:01.268 --> 42:03.521
Please, don't! I, Jin Mu,

42:04.146 --> 42:08.776
your pupil, promise I'll never perform
the alchemy of souls that you taught me.

42:08.859 --> 42:10.903
My Master, I swear!

42:29.630 --> 42:31.882
I should have cut off
his energy flow then.

42:34.843 --> 42:36.178
I shouldn't have hidden the ice stone,

42:36.262 --> 42:38.389
but instead, let everyone know
of my wrongdoings,

42:38.973 --> 42:40.432
and destroyed it at Songrim.

42:43.227 --> 42:45.312
How did Jin Mu find the ice stone…

42:47.314 --> 42:49.275
that I sealed in Lake Gyeoncheondaeho?

42:50.359 --> 42:51.860
Did someone find it for him?

43:23.726 --> 43:25.477
I feel completely fine.

43:27.313 --> 43:29.481
There is only one difference between us.

43:30.983 --> 43:31.900
That is…

43:34.486 --> 43:35.779
I am a soul shifter.

43:39.366 --> 43:40.743
- Hey, Beom.
- Huh?

43:41.577 --> 43:43.537
You can just train hard again.

43:43.621 --> 43:46.206
Yeah, exactly.
It's going to be fine.

43:46.290 --> 43:47.499
Yes, come on, cheer up.

43:47.583 --> 43:50.669
The ice stone is taking
all of their energy.

43:50.753 --> 43:53.714
If I shift my soul
and take the energy of the ice stone,

43:54.298 --> 43:56.967
does that mean
I will take all of their energy, too?

43:57.468 --> 43:59.470
When something is gained,
something is lost.

44:00.137 --> 44:02.890
That is the burden of the person
who uses its power.

44:03.932 --> 44:05.768
So for me to take the power…

44:07.895 --> 44:10.189
I have to take
all of their powers as well.

44:11.565 --> 44:12.399
Then,

44:13.067 --> 44:14.401
they will probably die.

44:25.871 --> 44:27.331
She meant I'd have to bear

44:28.207 --> 44:30.084
the deaths of all those people, too.

44:33.837 --> 44:36.131
Filthy Mu-deok,
what are you doing here?

44:42.846 --> 44:44.181
He will die, too.

44:45.182 --> 44:46.016
It's dangerous.

44:46.600 --> 44:48.143
If you touch the barrier by accident,

44:48.727 --> 44:50.688
someone like you
could get seriously injured.

44:50.771 --> 44:51.855
Get away from it!

44:56.443 --> 44:58.153
Are you not going to say,
"Thank you, sire"?

44:59.988 --> 45:02.282
Have I not worried
quite a bit for you just now?

45:05.327 --> 45:07.246
You had your energy taken earlier.

45:08.372 --> 45:09.581
Do you feel okay?

45:11.750 --> 45:14.211
Are you returning my worry
by worrying about me?

45:15.295 --> 45:16.422
All right, that's fair.

45:17.548 --> 45:19.299
Well, I seem to be okay, though.

45:20.467 --> 45:21.635
I'm very sorry.

45:21.719 --> 45:22.553
For what?

45:23.053 --> 45:26.557
You couldn't eat anything
since my noodle soup

45:27.099 --> 45:28.767
and everything I cooked wasn't good.

45:34.481 --> 45:35.983
Have this at least.

45:40.404 --> 45:41.864
It's Jang Uk's favorite biscuit.

45:42.531 --> 45:44.908
Are you sharing the snack
you kept to give your master?

45:44.992 --> 45:47.494
I'm fine. You eat it.

45:49.413 --> 45:52.374
Remember!
I should have taken those biscuits…

45:53.917 --> 45:55.961
but chose to leave them for you.

45:56.795 --> 45:57.713
I'm giving…

46:00.674 --> 46:02.301
all of them to you, all right.

46:03.844 --> 46:06.930
Even though he's selfish,
he has given me a lot.

46:10.517 --> 46:11.393
Please, take one.

46:11.477 --> 46:13.604
I'm giving it to you
in all sincerity, too.

46:14.980 --> 46:16.940
- You're sincere?
- Yes.

46:17.608 --> 46:18.609
I am sincere.

46:20.444 --> 46:22.279
Thank you for everything, sire.

46:27.576 --> 46:29.203
No, thanks. If you're gonna
give something,

46:30.162 --> 46:32.956
give me something bigger, okay?
Next time, instead.

46:34.833 --> 46:36.251
I like gifts that are bigger.

46:43.675 --> 46:44.968
Please, just take it.

46:46.470 --> 46:48.180
It is just the right amount for you.

46:52.267 --> 46:54.102
Filthy Mu-deok, you really are…

46:56.271 --> 46:59.191
You always come so ridiculously close
that it is almost rude,

46:59.775 --> 47:02.361
but if I try to catch you,
you move away again.

47:05.739 --> 47:07.324
The reason I don't want to try…

47:09.159 --> 47:11.370
is because if I can't catch you
when I am trying hard…

47:16.834 --> 47:19.586
Never mind. I will not accept that much.

47:33.058 --> 47:35.811
I would have felt less sorry
if he had taken it from me.

47:39.815 --> 47:40.649
That's right.

47:41.733 --> 47:44.194
This is just the right amount
I should feel sorry for.

48:08.510 --> 48:09.344
Mu-deok.

48:12.222 --> 48:13.682
I have a favor to ask.

48:14.391 --> 48:16.643
Could you go to the mages' residence hall?

48:17.978 --> 48:19.104
What for?

48:19.187 --> 48:22.190
The air is so humid.
Could you get me a new blanket?

48:23.108 --> 48:24.693
I was told they're in there.

48:38.874 --> 48:40.083
All right, then.

49:00.228 --> 49:01.438
What are you doing?

49:01.980 --> 49:04.107
The fire is dying,
so I am trying to bring it back.

49:23.043 --> 49:24.878
Goodness.

49:24.962 --> 49:26.254
Ugh, seriously?

49:26.838 --> 49:28.090
Are you stupid?

49:29.841 --> 49:31.510
- Argh.
- Hold on.

49:35.055 --> 49:37.849
Did you really just say that I was stupid?

49:37.933 --> 49:39.601
There are so many books in this study,

49:39.685 --> 49:41.269
and you could have almost burned them all.

49:41.353 --> 49:43.313
I could have controlled that using spells,

49:43.397 --> 49:44.815
but I can't use them now.

49:46.066 --> 49:47.317
So I was flustered.

49:47.401 --> 49:50.320
Even if you can't,
you could have still put a lid on it.

49:50.904 --> 49:52.614
I heard you were a prodigy,

49:52.698 --> 49:54.616
but you don't know how to use a lid
when you get confused.

49:54.700 --> 49:57.077
- You're just thick-headed.
- Don't insult me.

49:57.160 --> 49:58.704
It will make me angry.

50:00.539 --> 50:02.040
So you do get angry?

50:03.417 --> 50:06.003
You used to always be calm
like lukewarm water.

50:06.086 --> 50:08.839
Even lukewarm water can boil
and freeze, too.

50:09.715 --> 50:11.216
It's not always the same.

50:19.474 --> 50:21.893
It's very humid because of the fog.

50:21.977 --> 50:23.937
Is that why your injured leg is aching?

50:26.898 --> 50:29.443
You… remembered my injury.

50:30.402 --> 50:32.821
I'm fine. Do not worry.

50:37.325 --> 50:39.536
You said you liked pine pollen tea snacks.

50:41.705 --> 50:43.206
I never got to make you any.

50:44.249 --> 50:45.751
You remembered that as well.

50:47.586 --> 50:49.129
Does it matter if I remembered

50:49.838 --> 50:51.590
if I have not done anything for you?

50:52.466 --> 50:54.509
Then, make it for me next time.

50:57.763 --> 50:58.930
There is no next time.

50:59.431 --> 51:02.851
If I shift my soul, he will die here, too.

51:03.643 --> 51:04.519
No, wait.

51:04.603 --> 51:06.897
If you teach me how to make tea snacks,

51:06.980 --> 51:09.941
I can make them, too, like last time.

51:10.609 --> 51:11.443
You remember?

51:19.159 --> 51:19.993
All…

51:21.078 --> 51:23.163
my memories of Danhyanggok are wonderful.

51:32.881 --> 51:35.801
Seo Yul… is going to die.

51:40.680 --> 51:43.642
I was on my way to the residence hall
to get a blanket.

51:43.725 --> 51:44.559
I should go.

51:53.193 --> 51:56.071
I will go to the residence hall,
so you go find Uk.

52:05.622 --> 52:07.165
I know he's been looking for you.

52:20.053 --> 52:22.055
I have to go back
to being Naksu.

52:22.931 --> 52:24.808
Then I can cut off Seo Yul for good.

52:27.269 --> 52:29.271
I have to cut ties with everyone.

52:42.284 --> 52:44.286
Glaring at the barrier
will not break it.

52:51.751 --> 52:52.794
You see that?

52:53.670 --> 52:54.838
The rock went right through.

52:56.089 --> 52:56.923
It did.

52:58.049 --> 53:00.218
Can objects without water
pass through the barrier?

53:00.302 --> 53:01.386
What an odd barrier!

53:01.928 --> 53:04.806
Some things can go through,
but other things cannot.

53:04.890 --> 53:06.266
Are there barriers like that?

53:07.058 --> 53:08.727
What are they doing out there?

53:08.810 --> 53:12.564
With all those mages gathered
around there, they can't break it through?

53:13.982 --> 53:15.734
Is it because
it's the ice stone that made it?

53:15.817 --> 53:19.654
They are probably just too busy fighting
over the ice stone to even try anything.

53:19.738 --> 53:23.450
How can that be more important?
I am here, you know!

53:24.492 --> 53:29.247
It seems you are not as important
to Her Majesty as the ice stone.

53:30.790 --> 53:32.167
What mother acts like that?

53:33.251 --> 53:35.086
She acts exactly like my father.

53:37.255 --> 53:38.089
Indeed.

53:38.840 --> 53:42.510
Everyone already knows,
the queen is not my real mother.

53:43.678 --> 53:45.513
Just like Jang Gang isn't your father.

53:47.682 --> 53:49.184
That is what they all say around here.

53:50.018 --> 53:51.937
I don't care if it hurts
your feelings or not.

53:52.646 --> 53:54.522
I'll also get straight to the point, sire.

53:55.232 --> 53:58.944
Will you be able to kill
the Queen and Jin Mu even if they

53:59.027 --> 54:00.403
offer the ice stone to you?

54:03.823 --> 54:07.702
If such a great power comes to me,
it may be hard to give that up. Yes.

54:08.787 --> 54:09.871
You're very brave.

54:11.373 --> 54:14.000
Being open about your own desires
requires courage, sire.

54:18.338 --> 54:19.422
Then what about you?

54:19.923 --> 54:21.841
What will you do
if you actually get the ice stone?

54:25.345 --> 54:27.222
I'll do as Master Seo Gyeong did.

54:27.305 --> 54:28.473
Seo Gyeong?

54:30.058 --> 54:32.894
Do you mean you wish to become
a hero with the fate of the King's Star

54:32.978 --> 54:34.813
by destroying every ice stone, then?

54:34.896 --> 54:38.483
I think that purpose was
also his true intention.

54:40.986 --> 54:43.446
But so is hiding one of the ice stones

54:43.530 --> 54:45.156
to save someone precious to him.

54:45.657 --> 54:48.118
Well, I…
…prefer that story, anyway.

54:51.454 --> 54:53.373
You said that is what written
in The Words of the Heart?

54:54.040 --> 54:57.335
In the end, it's just a cowardly excuse
as to why he could not give up the power.

54:58.128 --> 54:59.421
Who would actually believe that?

54:59.504 --> 55:00.880
Oh, I can believe it.

55:02.841 --> 55:05.510
I would have done the same thing.

55:23.028 --> 55:24.154
What?

55:24.237 --> 55:26.072
Rocks can pass through, right?

55:26.156 --> 55:28.658
Write a letter telling them to save you
and throw it through the barrier.

55:31.870 --> 55:32.704
Jang Uk.

55:34.164 --> 55:35.290
You're a genius.

55:43.715 --> 55:45.884
- Dumb barrier!
- Hey, Uk.

55:46.634 --> 55:48.470
Is there a bigger rock?

55:48.553 --> 55:50.347
You just need to
tell them to rescue you.

55:50.430 --> 55:52.140
Why do you need a bigger one?

55:52.223 --> 55:53.641
We need to write it big.

55:54.434 --> 55:56.561
Hey, is this… is this rock embedded here?

55:59.481 --> 56:00.565
Cheers.

56:01.733 --> 56:05.487
I mean, I don't understand,
how could Dang-gu hide this wine here

56:05.570 --> 56:06.738
and not tell us about it?

56:06.821 --> 56:09.282
I know.
We should drink it all. Go on!

56:09.366 --> 56:11.368
- Let us drink. Let us drink.
- Come on guys! Drink up!

56:16.539 --> 56:17.916
Here's the brazier.

56:20.377 --> 56:21.503
Mu-deok.

56:22.087 --> 56:23.880
Why are you here?

56:23.963 --> 56:25.048
What do you mean?

56:26.049 --> 56:29.636
Ah, Young Master Seo Yul went
to go fetch the blankets instead.

56:34.766 --> 56:36.643
So I'm going to kill him first.

57:07.132 --> 57:09.634
Young Master Seo,
you must not go in there.

57:10.885 --> 57:13.138
- What's going on?
- Please, turn back.

57:14.931 --> 57:17.350
Can you see me right now?

57:17.434 --> 57:19.519
Uh, about that…

57:50.425 --> 57:51.968
Young Master!

58:22.415 --> 58:23.708
Young Master!

58:25.585 --> 58:28.713
Young Master! Oh, no! Young Master!

58:46.981 --> 58:47.857
Young Master!

59:12.465 --> 59:13.299
What?

59:13.841 --> 59:15.718
Who are you?

59:44.539 --> 59:46.874
Yul! Yul! Yul!

59:53.339 --> 59:55.300
- Young Master!
- Are you all right?

01:00:27.498 --> 01:00:28.333
Yul.

01:00:30.293 --> 01:00:32.086
- What happened?
- A soul shifter.

01:00:32.170 --> 01:00:33.338
There's a soul shifter.

01:00:33.421 --> 01:00:34.672
What?

01:00:38.176 --> 01:00:39.010
There's a soul shifter.

01:00:39.594 --> 01:00:42.221
A soul shifter has consumed
Yun-su and Jin-ho's energy.

01:00:57.862 --> 01:01:01.032
The soul shifter is Master Kang.
He is a very strong mage.

01:01:01.115 --> 01:01:04.452
To make matters worse,
he's using energy to cast spells.

01:01:04.535 --> 01:01:06.746
It's impossible.
No one can cast spells in this place.

01:01:07.455 --> 01:01:08.873
How could a soul shifter do it?

01:01:08.956 --> 01:01:12.877
Even though we lose our energy here,
I think it is the opposite for them.

01:01:15.838 --> 01:01:17.674
What if my powers return

01:01:18.299 --> 01:01:20.468
and Naksu decides to run away with them?

01:01:21.135 --> 01:01:23.888
You may have to face death
if you end up getting caught.

01:01:25.348 --> 01:01:26.557
Aren't you afraid?

01:01:26.641 --> 01:01:28.726
I guess I'm a little afraid

01:01:28.810 --> 01:01:33.231
that you might just abandon me without
my promise even crossing your mind.

01:01:35.650 --> 01:01:38.319
- Jang Uk, I--
- Young Master Jang.

01:01:42.407 --> 01:01:45.368
Where is Mu-deok?
Mu-deok, where is she, huh?

01:01:45.952 --> 01:01:47.745
She was with us earlier.

01:01:48.371 --> 01:01:49.330
Where did she go?

01:01:56.337 --> 01:01:58.131
So there was something in my way.

01:02:08.683 --> 01:02:10.476
They will all die at this rate.

01:02:13.062 --> 01:02:15.940
When I shift my soul,
they'll all perish, anyway.

01:02:16.023 --> 01:02:17.942
It doesn't make any sense to help them.

01:02:19.068 --> 01:02:20.945
It will be the best way to cut ties.

01:02:25.783 --> 01:02:27.493
This is the very last time

01:02:28.578 --> 01:02:31.330
I will help them. After this, though,

01:02:32.248 --> 01:02:33.291
never again.

01:02:35.877 --> 01:02:36.711
Mu-deok.

01:02:38.254 --> 01:02:40.673
- Where have you been?
- I'm here, aren't I?

01:02:41.466 --> 01:02:42.300
Uk has…

01:02:43.176 --> 01:02:44.385
Uk is going to die.

01:03:05.865 --> 01:03:07.492
No one can beat him in here.

01:03:08.326 --> 01:03:09.452
We can't all die.

01:03:10.036 --> 01:03:12.455
So I'll lure him into
the Secret Room and lock him up.

01:03:16.167 --> 01:03:19.170
If Uk is trapped
in the Secret Room with that soul shifter,

01:03:19.253 --> 01:03:20.588
he's going to die.

01:03:21.130 --> 01:03:22.089
Why?

01:03:23.007 --> 01:03:24.842
Why did my young master go alone?

01:03:25.468 --> 01:03:27.303
He said it had to be him,

01:03:27.929 --> 01:03:29.347
that it was his responsibility.

01:03:36.729 --> 01:03:39.315
- Where do you think you are going?
- I need to check that room.

01:03:40.691 --> 01:03:42.610
If the door is not actually closed,

01:03:44.111 --> 01:03:46.656
that means he died
before luring the soul shifter.

01:03:46.739 --> 01:03:48.241
And if the door is locked,

01:03:49.158 --> 01:03:50.618
that means he died inside.

01:03:51.536 --> 01:03:52.662
There's nothing you can do.

01:03:55.206 --> 01:03:57.291
You said you would not try to catch me.

01:03:58.876 --> 01:04:00.336
You cannot stop me.

01:04:01.629 --> 01:04:02.713
Let me go.

01:05:01.188 --> 01:05:04.692
And if the door is locked,
that means he died inside.

01:05:09.572 --> 01:05:12.992
Regret is felt last minute,
and it's irreversible.

01:05:14.577 --> 01:05:15.453
Jang Uk.

01:08:09.668 --> 01:08:11.087
You are alive…

01:08:13.255 --> 01:08:14.590
my dear pupil.

01:08:33.943 --> 01:08:35.569
Why did you hide your power?

01:08:39.740 --> 01:08:40.616
So…

01:08:42.868 --> 01:08:44.120
you would die, too.

01:08:45.955 --> 01:08:46.872
Then why…

01:08:48.332 --> 01:08:49.291
did you come?

01:08:52.962 --> 01:08:53.963
Because…

01:08:58.300 --> 01:08:59.760
…I was afraid you'd die.

01:09:06.475 --> 01:09:08.185
Now that you've drawn your sword…

01:09:09.603 --> 01:09:10.896
you must decide.

01:09:14.150 --> 01:09:15.651
I know you've been avoiding it.

01:09:15.734 --> 01:09:18.362
And I know that
your decision could kill all of us.

01:09:22.908 --> 01:09:24.118
As we promised,

01:09:25.202 --> 01:09:26.912
point your sword at me first.

01:09:40.801 --> 01:09:42.219
You stab me,

01:09:42.303 --> 01:09:45.014
and I'll take responsibility
for setting Naksu upon the world,

01:09:46.098 --> 01:09:46.974
and I will die.

01:09:49.810 --> 01:09:50.644
If you don't…

01:09:51.937 --> 01:09:53.731
well, at that time,
I will make you another promise.

01:10:17.338 --> 01:10:18.172
Now…

01:10:22.968 --> 01:10:24.637
make your next promise…

01:10:26.388 --> 01:10:28.224
to me right now, Young Master.

01:11:41.547 --> 01:11:44.842
What human being would be able
to refuse such a great power?

01:11:44.925 --> 01:11:47.219
In order to protect
what must be protected.

01:11:47.303 --> 01:11:48.721
What if I gave it everything?

01:11:48.804 --> 01:11:50.597
I'm trying to do the same.

01:11:51.265 --> 01:11:53.183
What is he doing here?

01:11:53.267 --> 01:11:55.769
Jin Bu-yeon's immense divine powers

01:11:55.853 --> 01:11:57.938
did not only come from
her mother of the Jin family.

01:11:58.022 --> 01:12:01.900
Park Jin! You knew everything
and decided to hide it.

01:12:03.235 --> 01:12:05.612
When it does,
those who must go will go,

01:12:05.696 --> 01:12:07.740
and those who must return will return.

01:12:07.823 --> 01:12:10.409
Young Master, do what you must do.

01:12:10.492 --> 01:12:12.077
It's spirit
instead of being full of it.

01:12:12.161 --> 01:12:15.247
I'm going to do just that.
Just as my master taught me to.

01:12:15.331 --> 01:12:17.666
- …look that pretty?
- Wow!

01:12:17.750 --> 01:12:19.626
I heard there was a bride
getting married soon.
